{"id":"trave_s","lemma":"través","pos":"noun","rank":544,"glosses":["bend, turn"],"ipa":"/tɾaˈbes/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"traveses"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-trav%C3%A9s.wav","examples":[{"text":"Caminamos a través del hielo.","en":"We walked across the ice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582539","words":[{"g":"to walk","l":"caminar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"ice"}]},{"text":"Él estaba mirando a través de un microscopio.","en":"He was looking through a microscope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/616231","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to look at","l":"mirar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"microscope"}]},{"text":"Tom se sentó mirando a través de la ventana.","en":"Tom sat looking out of the window.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/410611","words":[null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"to look at","l":"mirar"},{"g":"to"},null,null,null,{"g":"window"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"La última parte del viaje fue a través del desierto.","en":"The last part of the trip was across the desert.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"final","l":"último"},{"g":"part"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"voyage"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"desert"}]},{"text":"Él nadó a través del río.","en":"He swam across the river.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to swim","l":"nadar"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"river"}]}]}